      "value": "Watchdog-to-NoC bridge that serializes watchdog events through a 7-stage FIFO pipeline for NoC transport.",
      "explanation": "The module connects a watchdog timer (utt_wd) to a Network-on-Chip interface via a chain of 7 cFifo1_pwm instances (fifo0-fifo6). The i_drive event with i_msg payload enters the pipeline, propagates through fifo0-fifo6, and exits as o_drive with o_msg payload. The i_free/o_free signals provide backpressure or flow control at the pipeline boundaries.",
